    "texto": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">L</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Poppins; font-size: 15px;\">La</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Poppins; font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Poppins; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">SECRETAR&Iacute;A DE MOVILIDAD URBANA</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Poppins; font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Poppins; font-size: 15px;\">te ayuda a que planificar tu viaje en las lineas de trasnporte de competencia municipal (1 a la 19), a trav&eacute;s de la aplicaci&oacute;n \"Cuando SUBO\".</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; color: #767676; font-size: 15px; line-height: 29px; font-family: Poppins, serif; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Esta herramienta tecnol&oacute;gica te permite acceder en tiempo real a la ubicaci&oacute;n y al tiempo estimado de llegada de las unidades del trasporte p&uacute;blico en San Miguel de Tucum&aacute;n.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; color: #767676; font-size: 15px; line-height: 29px; font-family: Poppins, serif; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Adem&aacute;s, la aplicaci&oacute;n permite guardar ubicaciones y recorridos frecuentes par</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">a acceder r&aacute;pidamente a la informaci&oacute;n.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; color: #767676; font-size: 15px; line-height: 29px; font-family: Poppins, serif; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Con esta app vas a poder:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #767676; font-family: Poppins, serif;\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Planificar mejor tus viajes. Evitar esperas innecesarias en las paradas</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Moverte con mayor seguridad y comodidad por la ciudad</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; color: #767676; font-size: 15px; line-height: 29px; font-family: Poppins, serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">La app es gratuita y est&aacute; disponible para celulares con sistema operativo Andrioid e iOS</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; color: #767676; font-size: 15px; line-height: 29px; font-family: Poppins, serif;\">Buscala en el PlayStore o en el AppStore</p>",
